    ('admin.theme.notes', 'zh-CN', '主题 = 站点前端项目（全局颜色/字体/页眉页脚引用），一次一套激活；页面挂在主题下。切换激活主题即整站前端换皮，页面内容不动。「设置」里编辑颜色与字体，保存后合入该主题下全部页面，构建产物注入 :root CSS 变量——已发布页面需重新构建才会带新主题。', 200, 'admin', 'admin/theme.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.theme.notes', 'en-US', 'A theme is the site front-end project (global colors, fonts, header and footer references); one theme is active at a time and pages hang off it. Activating another theme reskins the whole front end while page content stays put. Edit colors and fonts under Settings; saving merges them into every page of that theme, and the build injects them as :root CSS variables — published pages need a rebuild before they carry the new theme.', 200, 'admin', 'admin/theme.html', 1, now(), now()),

