    ('admin.theme_settings.notes_heading', 'zh-CN', '说明', 200, 'admin', 'admin/theme_settings.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.theme_settings.notes_heading', 'en-US', 'Notes', 200, 'admin', 'admin/theme_settings.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.theme_settings.notes', 'zh-CN', '所有设计令牌保存后合入该主题下全部页面的文档（settings.theme），构建产物注入 :root CSS 变量（--sky-c-* 色板、--sky-heading-* / --sky-body-* / --sky-link-* 排版、--sky-btn-* 按钮、--sky-radius / --sky-border-* / --sky-shadow 表面、--sky-tr-duration / --sky-easing 动效）——组件中 var(--sky-*) 全局生效；已发布页面需重新构建才会带新主题。页眉/页脚块在构建页面时编译期内联进产物（访问面保持纯静态），保存后该主题下页面将标记为待重建。没有候选块？先到「全局块」新建页眉/页脚块。', 200, 'admin', 'admin/theme_settings.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.theme_settings.notes', 'en-US', 'Saving merges every design token into the documents of all pages in this theme (settings.theme), and the build injects them as :root CSS variables (the --sky-c-* palette; --sky-heading-* / --sky-body-* / --sky-link-* typography; --sky-btn-* buttons; --sky-radius / --sky-border-* / --sky-shadow surfaces; --sky-tr-duration / --sky-easing motion) — so var(--sky-*) works everywhere in components, and published pages need a rebuild before they carry the new theme. Header and footer blocks are inlined into the artifacts at build time (the public site stays purely static); after saving, the pages of this theme are marked for rebuild. No candidate blocks? Create a header or footer block under Global blocks first.', 200, 'admin', 'admin/theme_settings.html', 1, now(), now()),

