    ('admin.blocks.notes', 'zh-CN', '全局块 = 跨页面复用的结构片段（对应 WP 的 HTML 块 / template part）。页眉/页脚块在「主题管理 → 设置」里绑定到主题，构建页面时编译期内联进产物——访问面保持纯静态；块内容变更后，绑定了它的主题下页面自动标为待重建。', 200, 'admin', 'admin/blocks.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.blocks.notes', 'en-US', 'A global block is a structure fragment reused across pages (the WordPress HTML block or template part equivalent). Header and footer blocks are bound to a theme under Theme management → Settings and inlined into the artifacts at build time — the public site stays purely static. When a block changes, the pages of the themes that bind it are marked for rebuild.', 200, 'admin', 'admin/blocks.html', 1, now(), now()),
